    dct:source "Geldner et al. (2001) Nature 413:425-428 Fig. 1 & Heisler et al. (2005) Curr. Biol. 15:1899-1911: PIN1 predominantly plasma-membrane localised in untreated meristem cells (qualitative; >= 0.9 used as a band edge, not a measured value)" ;
    schema:about "Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis & subepidermal provascular strand); Aeonium tabuliforme (spiral rosette specimen)" ;
