    dct:source "Scarpella et al. (2006) Genes Dev 20:1015-1027 & Bayer et al. (2009) Genes Dev 23:373-384: PIN1-marked preprocambial / midvein strands are narrow files 1-2 cells wide (reference 1, band 1-2)" ;
    schema:about "Arabidopsis thaliana (shoot apical meristem L1 epidermis & subepidermal provascular strand); Aeonium tabuliforme (spiral rosette specimen)" ;
